
Phase 1: Go Foundations (Day 1–10)

    Go basics, variables, control flow
    Functions, arrays, slices, maps
    Structs, pointers, error handling
    Project: Build small utilities (calculator, text processor)


Phase 2: CLI Tools & File Handling (Day 11–20)

    File & directory operations
    Command-line tools using flags
    JSON & YAML parsing
    Logging & configs
    Projects:
        File organizer CLI
        Log parser
        Config reader tool


Phase 3: API & Automation Projects (Day 21–30)

    HTTP requests & API handling
    Build API-based tools
    Web scraping basics
    Concurrency (goroutines & channels)
    Projects:
        Weather CLI tool
        GitHub activity fetcher
        Parallel downloader


Advanced CLI Projects (Day 31–40)

    Process handling & system interaction
    Task automation scripts
    Retry logic & robustness
    Combining multiple features
    Projects:
        Task runner CLI
        Log monitoring tool
        Multi-feature automation CLI
